                <p>¥129</p>
                <a href="product-detail.html?id=2">查看详情</a>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x250" alt="职业套装">
                <h3>干练职业套装</h3>
                <p>¥399</p>
                <a href="product-detail.html?id=3">查看详情</a>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/200x250" alt="针织衫">
                <h3>柔软针织衫</h3>
